he superior edge  and 13 0cm from the inferior edge  Lesion  C  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan brown firm area located adjacent to lesion  B   and located 2 4cm from the posterior margin and 2 5cm from the anterior margin  Lesion  D  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan yellow papillary lesion  located adjacent to lesions  B  and  C   and is located 2 5cm from the nearest posterior margin and 2 4cm from the nearest anterior margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section through largest nodular mass  lesion A    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  contain closest anterior and posterior resection margins  respectively   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Intervening breast parenchyma between large mass  lesion A  and second largest mass  lesion B    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections through second largest mass  lesion B    Posterior margin is in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   anterior margin is in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section including lesion B and firm tan area  lesion C    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section through firm tan area  lesion C   lesion C is submitted in its entirety    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section through papillary lesion  lesion D    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma adjacent to papillary lesion  with posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of breast parenchyma away from discrete lesion  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast skin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE donut shaped skin ellipse  excised to a depth of 0 3cm  The soft tissue resection margin is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal no gross abnormalities  Tips are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and representatives sections through skin submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SEC