ial sections of the medial margins are submitted in cassettes E and F  showing the extension of fibrous tissue against the inked margin  A representative section of the fibrous tissue against the inferior margin is submitted in cassette G  Section containing the deep  posterior  margin with a small fibrous region on the inferior margin is submitted in cassette H  An additional section of the mass near the medial half is submitted in I  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary content   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is dissected to reveal lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 0 7cm in diameter  submitted in cassettes J through M  Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODES   report_end  , Unchecked.
