maroon clot  This cavity is situated within 0 1cm of the closest inked margin which is the deep margin  Surrounding the cavity is an area of fat necrosis and interparenchymal hemorrhage  Sectioning through the remaining portion of the specimen reveals fibroadipose tissue which is traversed by thick  pale tan  fibrous bands  The specimen also includes an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm axillary tail  A node dissection is undertaken and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm aggregate of tan brown lymph nodes is submitted in A E  Section Code A E   lymph nodes F   closest margin  deep G   additional representative deep section H J   representative sections of the superior surface K   representative lateral section L M   representative medial sections N   areola O P   additional sections adjacent to the superior portion of the biopsy cavity Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  , Unchecked.
